title: Hermann Göring
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, legalist
card-image: img/portraits/GoeringHermann.jpg
view-if: goering_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Hermann Göring

Göring [? if nsdap_reichstag_presidency = 1 : is ?][? if nsdap_reichstag_presidency = 0 : was ?] the President of the Reichstag. A charismatic war hero, he acts as our aristocratic ambassador to the high society and conservative establishment.

- @bourgeois_maneuver
- @prussian_infiltration
- @dissolve_parliament
- @root: Return to main

@bourgeois_maneuver
title: Courting the Establishment
subtitle: Göring can manipulate our relationships with the traditional conservative and centrist parties to tolerate us.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (nsdap_in_government or seeking_toleration or in_harzburg_front)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not nsdap_in_government : The NSDAP is completely isolated from government affairs. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; establishment_suspicion -= 1 if nsdap_in_government = 1 and establishment_suspicion > 0; dnvp_relation += 6; z_relation += 4; bvp_relation += 4; strasser_influence -= 2

We have improved our leverage with the Conservative (DNVP) and Center (Zentrum) parties, convincing them that we are a respectable alternative to the Marxist threat.

@prussian_infiltration
title: Subverting the Prussian Police
subtitle: Using our leverage over the central government or via the Prussian Coup, Göring can purge and nazify the Prussian security apparatus.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and papen_coup_seen = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if papen_coup_seen == 0 : The democratic SPD bulwark in Prussia has not yet been broken. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; prussian_police_nazification += 15; sa_militancy += 5; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: prussian_gestapo_formation

@dissolve_parliament
title: Force Dissolution of the Reichstag
subtitle: As Reichstag President, use procedural tricks to force a snap election while our popularity is high.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Hitler" and reichstag_president != "Göring" : We do not hold the Chancellorship or the Reichstag Presidency. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Hitler" or reichstag_president == "Göring")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 2 if next_election_time > time+2; next_election_month = month + 2 if next_election_time >= time+2; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+2; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; 

We have successfully outmaneuvered the chamber and forced a dissolution. New snap elections are set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
